{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../", "title": "API Reference"}, "next": {"link": "../orchestrator/", "title": "Orchestrator"}, "title": "Agents", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"agents\">\n<h1>Agents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#agents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-agent-base-agent\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>BaseAgent module.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentTerminationStatus</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">names=&lt;not</span> <span class=\"pre\">given&gt;</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">*values</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">module=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">qualname=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">type=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">start=1</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">boundary=None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/enum.html#enum.Enum\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Enum</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Represents the termination status of an agent.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus.SUCCESS\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">SUCCESS</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'success'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus.SUCCESS\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus.WARNING\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">WARNING</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'warning'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus.WARNING\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus.ERROR\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ERROR</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'error'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus.ERROR\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus.CRITICAL\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CRITICAL</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'critical'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentTerminationStatus.CRITICAL\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentConfig\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentConfig</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">logger_config</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">validation_policy</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentConfig\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClassConfig</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Base agent configuration class.</p>\n<p>Class attributes store default values for configuration parameters. These values can be\noverridden either in derived classes or through constructor arguments.</p>\n<p>User-defined attributes follow the same pattern, they can be set via constructor\narguments or overridden in derived classes.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>logger_config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\"><em>LoggerConfig</em></a>) \u2013 Configuration for the logger.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>validation_policy</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\"><em>ValidationPolicy</em></a>) \u2013 Policy for validation management.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>logger_config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\"><em>LoggerConfig</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>validation_policy</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\"><em>ValidationPolicy</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Examples</p>\n<p>Creating a custom configuration for a ChatAgent:</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">ChatAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">BaseAgent</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">model_name</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;gpt-3.5-turbo&quot;</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Default model name</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">max_tokens</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1000</span>             <span class=\"c1\"># Default maximum tokens per request</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">temperature</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.7</span>             <span class=\"c1\"># Default temperature for sampling</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Default configuration</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">default_chat_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Custom configuration</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">custom_chat_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">model_name</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;gpt-4&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">max_tokens</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">temperature</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">0.9</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentPlugin\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentPlugin</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentPlugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassPlugin\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClassPlugin</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Plugin class for agents.</p>\n<p>This class can contain various plugins that extend agent functionality.</p>\n<p>Plugins can be defined as class attributes (defaults) and overridden via constructor:</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">MyPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">AgentPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">zmq</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPubSub</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://*:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">zmq</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PUB</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Use default</span>\n<span class=\"n\">plugin1</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">MyPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Override heartbeat</span>\n<span class=\"n\">plugin2</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">MyPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">heartbeat</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">AgentHeartbeatTimerPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">config</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">plugin</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">a_type</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'process'</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">control_events</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state_events</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">msg_channel</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClass\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClass\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClass</span></code></a>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Abstract base class for all agents.</p>\n<p>This class provides a common interface for agent lifecycle management, defining\nthe essential methods that an agent must implement.</p>\n<p>Each agent manages two types of events:</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>state_events: For managing the agent\u2019s internal state</p></li>\n<li><p>control_events: For handling external commands</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Events are communicated to the orchestrator via message channel, allowing\ncentralized event management and coordination. The orchestrator handles\nall event processing and callback execution.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>When overriding methods, always call the parent implementation using super().</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Usage:</dt><dd><p>Derived classes must implement the <cite>execute</cite> method to define their core logic.\nThe <cite>setup</cite> method can be optionally overridden to perform initialization\nbefore the execution begins.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>config</strong> (<em>BaseAgentConfig</em>) \u2013 Configuration parameters that define the agent\u2019s behavior.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>plugin</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../plugins/#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.plugin_protocols.PluginProtocol\"><em>PluginProtocol</em></a>) \u2013 Plugin interface for agent extension.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>state_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\"><em>StateEvents</em></a>) \u2013 Events for internal state management.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>control_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\"><em>ControlEvents</em></a>) \u2013 Events for external command handling.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentConfig\"><em>AgentConfig</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>plugin</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentPlugin\"><em>AgentPlugin</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>a_type</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>control_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\"><em>ControlEvents</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>state_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\"><em>StateEvents</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>msg_channel</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.MessageChannel\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.MessageChannel\"><em>MessageChannel</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.run\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">run</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.run\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Main entry point for agent execution.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.setup\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">setup</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.setup\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Performs initialization when the agent starts.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.execute\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execute</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.execute\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Implements the agent\u2019s core logic.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.stop\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">stop</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.stop\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Requests external termination of the agent.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.validate_config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate_config</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.validate_config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Validates the configuration.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.on_stop\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">on_stop</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.on_stop\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Handles cleanup when the agent is stopped.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.Config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Config</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.Config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>alias of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentConfig</span></code></a></p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.Plugin\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Plugin</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.Plugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>alias of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentPlugin\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentPlugin</span></code></a></p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">StateEvents</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">start_event</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">ready_event</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">close_event</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Events related to the internal state of the agent.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>start_event</strong> \u2013 Event to signal that the agent is starting.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ready_event</strong> \u2013 Event to signal that the agent is ready to start the execution.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>close_event</strong> \u2013 Event to signal that the agent has completed the execution.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ControlEvents</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">setup_event</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">execute_event</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">stop_event</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Events related to external commands.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>setup_event</strong> \u2013 Event to signal that the agent can make the setup.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>execute_event</strong> \u2013 Event to signal that the agent can make the execution.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>stop_event</strong> \u2013 Event to signal that the agent must stop.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.start_time\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">start_time</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">float</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.start_time\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Timestamp when the agent started running.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.a_type\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">a_type</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">''</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.a_type\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The agent type (process or thread).</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.termination_status\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">termination_status</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.termination_status\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Agent termination status.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.plugin_manager\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">plugin_manager</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.plugin_manager\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Plugin manager for managing plugins.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.msg_channel\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">msg_channel</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.msg_channel\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Message channel for service communication.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id0\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">final</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">run</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id0\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;final</p>\n<p>Main method to run the agent.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>Do not override this method. If you need to implement custom logic when the agent is started, you can\noverride the <cite>setup</cite> and <cite>execute</cite> methods.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>This method is called by the <cite>run</cite> method of the derived classes. So it can be considered the entry point\nfor the agent execution.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id1\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">setup</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id1\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;template</p>\n<p>Performs initialization when the agent starts.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>When overriding, ensure to call the parent implementation.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Implement setup logic here. This method runs once before <cite>execute</cite>.</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Uses <cite>control_events.setup_event</cite> for execution control.</p></li>\n<li><p>Triggers <cite>state_events.ready_event</cite> upon completion.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id2\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execute</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id2\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;abstractmethod\nImplements the agent\u2019s core logic.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>When overriding, ensure to call the parent implementation.</p>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id3\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">final</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">stop</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id3\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;final</p>\n<p>Method to request the external stop of the agent.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>If you need to implement custom logic when the agent is being stopped, you can override the <cite>on_stop</cite> method.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>Do not override this method.</p>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id4\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">on_stop</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id4\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Handles cleanup when the agent is stopped.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Override this method to implement custom cleanup logic\nthat should execute when the agent is stopped.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.on_close\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">on_close</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.on_close\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Performs final cleanup when the agent is closing.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Override this method to implement custom cleanup logic\nthat should execute during agent shutdown.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.send_message\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send_message</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">msg</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.send_message\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Sends a message to the orchestrator.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>msg</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.ServiceMessage\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.ServiceMessage\"><em>ServiceMessage</em></a>) \u2013 The message to send.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.on_message\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">on_message</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">msg</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.on_message\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>React to orchestrator commands.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>msg</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.ServiceMessage\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.ServiceMessage\"><em>ServiceMessage</em></a>) \u2013 The received message.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseProcessAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseProcessAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseProcessAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseAgent</span></code></a>, <code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Process</span></code>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>BaseProcessAgent class.</p>\n<p>This class provides a common interface for agents that run in a separate process.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>BaseAgent</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 BaseAgent class.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>multiprocessing</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 multiprocessing module.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ABC</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 ABC module.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseProcessAgent.a_type\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">a_type</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'process'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseProcessAgent.a_type\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The agent type (process or thread).</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseThreadAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseThreadAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\