reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'thread'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseThreadAgent.a_type\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The agent type (process or thread).</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentProtocol</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">args</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Protocol\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Protocol</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Protocol defining the required interface for agent implementations.</p>\n<p>This protocol specifies the methods and attributes that any agent\nimplementation must provide.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol.a_type\">\n<span class=