lass=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol.is_alive\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bool</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol.validate_config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate_config</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol.validate_config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol.on_stop\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">on_stop</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol.on_stop\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-agent-looping-agent\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">LoopingAgentConfig</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">limit</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentConfig</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Looping agent configuration class.</p>\n<p>Class attributes store default values for configuration parameters. These values can be\noverridden either in derived classes or through constructor arguments.</p>\n<p>User-defined attributes follow the same pattern, they can be set via constructor\narguments or overridden in derived classes.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>limit</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 The maximum number of iterations, defaults to -1 (infinite).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>logger_config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\"><em>LoggerConfig</em></a>) \u2013 Logger configuration.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><strong>limit</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Examples</p>\n<p>Creating a custom configuration for a ChatAgent:</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">ChatAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">LoopingAgent</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">limit</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">int</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span>               <span class=\"c1\"># Default limit for the number of iterations</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">model_name</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;gpt-3.5-turbo&quot;</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Default model name</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">max_tokens</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1000</span>             <span class=\"c1\"># Default maximum tokens per request</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">temperature</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.7</span>             <span class=\"c1\"># Default temperature for sampling</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Create Default configuration</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">default_chat_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Create Custom configuration</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">custom_chat_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">limit</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">model_name</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;gpt-4&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">max_tokens</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">temperature</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">0.9</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig.limit\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">limit</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">-1</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig.limit\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The maximum number of iterations, defaults to -1 (infinite).</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig.validate\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig.validate\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Perform LoopingAgent-specific validation.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>List of validation results.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\">ValidationResult</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">LoopingAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseAgent</span></code></a></p>\n<p>LoopingAgent class.</p>\n<p>This class provides a common interface for agents that execute a cycle method in a loop.</p>\n<p>Each agent manages two types of events:</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>state_events: For managing the agent\u2019s internal state</p></li>\n<li><p>control_events: For handling external commands</p></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>When overriding methods, always call the parent implementation using super().</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Derived classes must implement the <cite>cycle</cite> method to define their core logic.\nThe <cite>setup</cite> method can be optionally overridden to perform initialization\nbefore the execution cycle begins.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>state_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\"><em>StateEvents</em></a>) \u2013 Events for internal state management.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>control_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\"><em>ControlEvents</em></a>) \u2013 Events for external command handling.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent.execute\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execute</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent.execute\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Executes the agent\u2019s core logic in a loop.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent.safe_cycle\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">safe_cycle</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent.safe_cycle\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Executes the agent\u2019s cycle method in a try-except block.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent.cycle\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">cycle</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent.cycle\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Defines the agent\u2019s core logic to be executed in each iteration of the loop.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent._info\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">_info</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent._info\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Logs the agent\u2019s configuration.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent.Config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Config</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent.Config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>alias of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LoopingAgentConfig</span></code></a></p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id5\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">final</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execute</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id5\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;final</p>\n<p>Execute the agent cycle method in a loop.</p>\n<p>If the limit is set, the loop will stop after reaching that, otherwise it will run indefinitely.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>Do not override this method.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>This method is a wrapper around the <cite>safe_cycle</cite> method that runs the agent\u2019s cycle logic in a loop.\nIt is used to ensure that the agent continues running even if well wknown exceptions are raised.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id6\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">final</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">safe_cycle</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id6\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;final</p>\n<p>Execute the agent\u2019s cycle logic to be executed in each iteration of\nthe loop in a try-except block.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>Do not override this method.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>This method is a wrapper around the <cite>cycle</cite> method that catches exceptions and logs them.\nIt is used to ensure that the agent continues running even if an exception is raised.\nIf a <cite>RecoverableException</cite> is raised, it will be logged as an error and the agent will continue.\nIf a <cite>NonRecoverableException</cite> is raised, it will be logged as an error and the agent will stop</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id7\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">cycle</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id7\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;abstractmethod</p>\n<p>Define the agent\u2019s cycle logic to be executed in each iteration of the loop.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>This method must be implemented in derived classes.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>This method must be implemented in derived classes.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingProcessAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">LoopingProcessAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingProcessAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LoopingAgent</span></code></a>, <code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Process</span></code>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>LoopingProcessAgent class.</p>\n<p>This class provides a common interface for agents that execute a cycle method in a loop using a separate process.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>LoopingAgent</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 LoopingAgent class.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>multiprocessing</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 multiprocessing module.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ABC</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 ABC module.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingThreadAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">LoopingThreadAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingThreadAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LoopingAgent</span></code></a>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/threading.html#threading.Thread\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Thread</span></code></a>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>LoopingThreadAgent class.</p>\n<p>This class provides a common interface for agents that execute a cycle method in a loop using a separate thread.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>LoopingAgent</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 LoopingAgent class.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>threading</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 threading module.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ABC</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 ABC module.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-agent-periodic-agent\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicAgentConfig</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">execution_interval</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">delay_compensation</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgentConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LoopingAgentConfig</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Periodic agent configuration class.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>execution_interval</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>) \u2013 The interval between two consecutive executions. Default is 1.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>delay_compensation</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>) \u2013 Compensate the delay in the execution. Default is False.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>limit</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 The maximum number of iterations, defaults to -1 (infinite).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>logger</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\"><em>LoggerConfig</em></a>) \u2013 Logger configuration.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>execution_interval</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>delay_compensation</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Class attributes store default values for the configuration parameters. If you want to change the default\nvalues, you can override them in the derived class or pass them as arguments to the constructor.</p>\n<p>User-defined attributes follow the same pattern. They can be passed as arguments to the constructor or\noverridden in the derived class.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Examples</p>\n<p>Creating a custom configuration for a PeriodicAgent:</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">PeriodicAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">PeriodicAgent</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">execution_interval</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Default execution interval</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">delay_compensation</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">False</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Default delay compensation</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">limit</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Default limit for the number of iterations</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Default configuration</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">default_periodic_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">PeriodicAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Custom configuration</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">custom_periodic_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">PeriodicAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">execution_interval</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">0.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">delay_compensation</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">limit</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig.execution_interval\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execution_interval</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">float</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">1</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig.execution_interval\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The interval between two consecutive executions.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig.delay_compensation\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delay_compensation</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">False</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig.delay_compensation\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Compensate the delay in the execution.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig.validate\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig.validate\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Perform PeriodicAgent-specific validation.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>List of validation results.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\">ValidationResult</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.looping_agent.LoopingAgent\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">LoopingAgent</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Periodic agent class.</p>\n<p>This agent executes a process periodically, with a fixed interval.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Derived classes must implement the <cite>runner</cite> method to define the logic to be executed. You can also implement the\n<cite>setup</cite> method to initialize some agent attributes before the cycle method (use super().setup()).</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>The <cite>cycle</cite> method must not be implemented in the derived class.</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.runner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">runner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.runner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The method to be executed periodically. This method must be implemented in the derived class.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.setup\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">setup</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.setup\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Setup method to initialize the agent. This method is called once before the agent cycle method.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.cycle\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">cycle</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.cycle\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The method that defines the agent\u2019s work to be done in each iteration of the loop.\nThis method must be implemented in the derived class.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.Config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Config</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.Config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>alias of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicAgentConfig</span></code></a></p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id8\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">setup</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id8\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;template</p>\n<p>Performs initialization when the agent starts.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>When overriding, ensure to call the parent implementation.</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Implement setup logic here. This method runs once before <cite>execute</cite>.</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Uses <cite>control_events.setup_event</cite> for execution control.</p></li>\n<li><p>Triggers <cite>state_events.ready_event</cite> upon completion.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id9\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">final</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">cycle</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id9\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Execute the agent cycle method in a loop.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#ValueError\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><strong>ValueError</strong></a> \u2013 _description_</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id10\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">runner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id10\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Here you have to implement the logic to be executed periodically.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.timer\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">timer</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.utilities.periodic_timer.PeriodicTimer\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.utilities.periodic_timer.PeriodicTimer\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicTimer</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent.timer\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicProcessAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicProcessAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicProcessAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicAgent</span></code></a>, <code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Process</span></code>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>PeriodicProcessAgent class.</p>\n<p>This class provides a common interface for agents that execute a cycle method in a loop using a separate process.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>PeriodicAgent</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 PeriodicAgent class.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>multiprocessing</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 multiprocessing module.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ABC</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 Abstract base class.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicThreadAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicThreadAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicThreadAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicAgent</span></code></a>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/threading.html#threading.Thread\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Thread</span></code></a>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>PeriodicThreadAgent class.</p>\n<p>This class provides a common interface for agents that execute a cycle method in a loop using a separate thread.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>PeriodicAgent</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 PeriodicAgent class.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>threading</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 threading module.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>ABC</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 Abstract base class.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-agent-pool-agent\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PoolAgentConfig</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agents_entry</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">auto_reboot</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgentConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicAgentConfig</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Pool agent configuration class.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>auto_reboot</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>) \u2013 Flag to enable automatic reboot of agents.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>agents_entry</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>list</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../orchestrator/#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\"><em>AgentEntry</em></a><em>]</em>) \u2013 List of agents to be registered.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>execution_interval</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>) \u2013 The interval of checking the agents.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>delay_compensation</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>) \u2013 Compensate the delay in the execution.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>logger</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\"><em>LoggerConfig</em></a>) \u2013 Logger configuration.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>agents_entry</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>list</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../orchestrator/#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\"><em>AgentEntry</em></a><em>] </em><em>| </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>auto_reboot</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Class attributes store default values for the configuration parameters. If you want to change the default\nvalues, you can override them in the derived class or pass them as arguments to the constructor.</p>\n<p>User-defined attributes follow the same pattern. They can be passed as arguments to the constructor or\noverridden in the derived class.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Examples</p>\n<p>Creating a custom configuration for a PoolAgent:</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">PoolAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">PeriodicAgent</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">auto_reboot</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">True</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Default auto reboot flag</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">agents_entry</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">AgentEntry</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">...</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">AgentEntry</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">...</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Default agents entry list</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">execution_interval</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Default execution interval</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">delay_compensation</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">True</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Default delay compensation</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Default configuration</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">default_pool_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">PoolAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"c1\"># Custom configuration</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">custom_pool_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">PoolAgentConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">auto_reboot</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">agents_entry</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">AgentEntry</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">...</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">AgentEntry</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">...</span><span class=\"p\">)],</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">execution_interval</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">delay_compensation</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig.agent_entry\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_entry</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../orchestrator/#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentEntry</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig.agent_entry\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig.auto_reboot\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">auto_reboot</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">False</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig.auto_reboot\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig.validate\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig.validate\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Implementation of specific validation for PoolAgent.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>List of validation results.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\">ValidationResult</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PoolAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.periodic_agent.PeriodicAgent\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PeriodicAgent</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Pool agent class.</p>\n<p>This agent is an orchestrator of BaseThreadAgent instances.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.Config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Config</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.Config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>alias of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgentConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PoolAgentConfig</span></code></a></p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.setup\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">setup</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.setup\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set up the PoolAgent.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>The PoolAgent act as an orchestrator for the agents. All agents found in the configuration are registered\nand started.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>You can override this method to add custom setup logic but remember to call super().setup() to ensure the\nagent is correctly initialized.</p>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.runner\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">final</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">runner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.runner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Check the status of the agents and restart them if necessary.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.pre_runner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">pre_runner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.pre_runner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;template</p>\n<p>Run before the runner method.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.post_runner\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">post_runner</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.post_runner\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;template</p>\n<p>Run after the runner method.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.orchestrator\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">orchestrator</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../orchestrator/#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator\"><span class=\"pre\">Orchestrator</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent.orchestrator\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolProcessAgent\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">PoolProcessAgent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolProcessAgent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.pool_agent.PoolAgent\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PoolAgent</span></code></a>, <code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Process</span></code>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>PoolProcessAgent class.</p>\n<p>This class provides a common interface for agents that execute a cycle method in a loop using a separate process.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>PoolAgent</strong> (<em>_type_</em>) \u2013 PoolAgent class.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>multiprocessing</strong> (<e